XR1710G B3: force-LRO queue remap - restore v1.9-era LRO mechanism
(airoha_qdma_lro_enable/lro_forced, force_lro module parameter,
 LRO users ownership lifecycle, napi_complete_done, GRO->LRO naming,
 SKB_GSO_DODGY, DSCP ring table 0=1024 / 2,4,11,15=128 / default 32)
Content = diff(prepare-replay product, xr-m3/lro-final snapshot).
